  "instructions": [
    "Peel and finely slice 2 large cucumbers into thin ribbons.",
    "In a bowl, combine 2 tbsp olive oil, 1 tbsp lemon juice, 1 tsp dried oregano, pinch of salt, pinch of pepper, and pinch of red pepper flakes.",
    "Toss the cucumber ribbons in the dressing until evenly coated.",
    "Let the salad rest for 5 minutes to allow flavors to meld.",
    "Stir again before serving to redistribute the seasoning.",
    "Garnish with a few fresh oregano leaves for extra aroma.",
    "Serve chilled or at room temperature.",
    "Enjoy immediately for maximum freshness."
  ],
